            "key": "who.3",
            "label": "First paragraph",
            "type": "textarea",
            "value": "We are a creative, digital and production services company building a strong global outsourcing practice for businesses that need reliable execution, consistent quality and the capacity to handle work at scale.<br><br>From creative design and video post-production to publishing, pre-press and print production, we help organisations streamline workflows, manage high-volume projects and extend their delivery capabilities without the cost and complexity of building larger in-house teams.<br><br>Our approach combines skilled professionals, structured workflows, quality-focused delivery and flexible engagement models to make outsourcing a seamless extension of your business.",
            "sort": 12
        },
        {
            "section": "who",
            "section_label": "02 Who We Are",
            "key": "who.4",
            "label": "Second paragraph",
            "type": "textarea",
            "value": "We believe outsourcing is more than delegating tasks. It is about building a dependable partnership that strengthens your operations and supports long-term growth.<br><br>Whether you need a dedicated team working alongside your organisation or a managed services partner to handle recurring production requirements, Intelliworkz offers the flexibility to adapt to your business needs.<br><br>We work with agencies, publishers, brands, production companies and enterprises that require dependable execution across large volumes of creative and production work. Our focus is on building lasting relationships through transparent communication, predictable delivery and the ability to scale with demand.",
            "sort": 13
